    "body": "Line: cross-state continuation · count 0/3 · headline M2 8/512 → 22/512.\n\nThe saved native learner now completes 22 of the unchanged 512 development replies under its own emitted prefixes: all 8 prior successes retained, 14 gained, none lost. This adds a shared Q4 energy jointly conditioned on factual post-bridge state, local query/reply-prefix state and the existing token prototype. The same delta reaches Generate and every physical Copy alias before the existing clip/pool. All upstream learned parameters remain frozen.\n\n**KEEP**, under the [prospective >8/512 bar](https://github.com/UOR-Foundation/uor-r4/issues/2030#issuecomment-6096164858). One fixed pass, 64 updates, 512 exposed examples, 6,664 answer/EOS positions; no checkpoint selection. Saved/reloaded native field SHA-256: `f61249ae4032a92d452689a52add6c9b5a67099f55b1a9291ba6f6f66a0d9acf`. Entry correctness 8→222, EOS endings 11→26, complete source-swap pairs 4→5. All five earlier candidate success sets are retained. Independent saved-output review reproduces the result.\n\nThe gain resets the inherited 4/3 non-moving count. It does not reopen the closed ordinary 24/96 recipe or the protected constructor/attribution/solver line. Zero preparation PRs.\n\n**If this came out the other way, would my next step differ? Yes.** No gain would close/archive this intervention without another dose/rate/seed series. The measured gain retains this model and supports a registered continuation after protected delivery and cleanup.\n\nM2 remains unmet: target ≥256/512, then ≥40% on a prospectively frozen fresh draw. These 512 examples are exposed development data; 490 still fail. No fresh qualification, general chat, geometric advantage, unique causal necessity of the factual carrier, or energy improvement is claimed. The historical conditional 9/15 gate is a separate artifact and was not rerun.\n\nCanonical record: [docs/labs/m2-cross-state-2026-10-10/README.md](docs/labs/m2-cross-state-2026-10-10/README.md), with configuration, independent reader/result, producer hashes and verified iCloud preservation receipt. Archive 49,111,040 bytes, MD5 `55c629e241eabb89cf10bfb8cf13bd4a`; full streamed readback and index verified. Measured model process 433.259s; complete cycle/build/review/delivery and pod cost close out after cleanup.\n\n- [x] Exact-head checks: 33 distinct tests PASS at `ee8d457cdab6a9e005178e9737b0f55380bf3537`; commands/outcomes posted in issuecomment6096539634 before queueing.\n- [x] Independent exact-head review PASS at that head; measured producer source920e420 differs only by later documentation/comments and merged main docs.\n- [x] Research record and newest-first current-state entry with Next.\n- [x] README, STATUS and ROADMAP updated; #2028 table updates after verified merge.\n- [x] Claim-wording and scoped formatting/diff checks pass.\n- [x] After merge: fresh main/whole-tree verification, branch/worktree removal, hygiene, issue/tracker result complete. Full cost closeout follows in a PR comment after pod deletion.\n\nReferences #2030. The continuous standing goal remains active after this result cycle.\n",
